Validate a compact Array of Doubles (array tuple) sketch's entries.

The same invariants as compact Theta sketches (0014): an empty sketch holds
no entries, theta does not exceed MAX_THETA, and the keys lie in (0, theta),
strictly increasing when ordered and never repeated. An image flagged empty
but carrying an entry, found by data.sketches tools/fuzz, re-serialized with
the zero seed hash 5.3.0 writes for empty sketches, and was then refused on
reading. Both the bytes and the stream overloads check.

